{"id":"5dd0bb3454409e5e","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-recursive-rank-of-tree.md","title":"ZFC Recursive Rank Of Tree","display":"df-zfc-recursive-rank-of-tree — ZFC Recursive Rank Of Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursive-rank-of-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursive-rank-of-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-recursive-rank-of-tree — ZFC Recursive Rank Of Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-rank-of-tree.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-recursive-recursive-tree.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursive-rank-of-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursive-rank-of-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursive-rank-of-tree — ZFC Recursive Rank Of Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e2657e44f434ef2b\" href=\"?note=e2657e44f434ef2b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-rank-of-tree.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-rank-of-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"47428b1b395aeb9d\" href=\"?note=47428b1b395aeb9d\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-recursive-recursive-tree.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-recursive-recursive-tree.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,T\\in V\">\\(\\rho,T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RankOfTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RankOfTree}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveRecursiveTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveRecursiveTree}_S\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e2657e44f434ef2b\" href=\"?note=e2657e44f434ef2b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-rank-of-tree.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-rank-of-tree.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"47428b1b395aeb9d\" href=\"?note=47428b1b395aeb9d\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-recursive-recursive-tree.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-recursive-recursive-tree.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveRankOfTree}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveRankOfTree}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}rank\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveRankOfTree}_S(\\rho,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveRecursiveTree}_S(T)\\land\\mathrm{RankOfTree}_S(\\rho,T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}rank\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveRankOfTree}_S(\\rho,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveRecursiveTree}_S(T)\\land\\mathrm{RankOfTree}_S(\\rho,T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical rank predicate supplies prefix closure, well-foundedness, ordinal values, and the full extension recursion; the recursive-tree conjunct supplies computability.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-rank-of-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"e2657e44f434ef2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-rank-of-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-recursive-recursive-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"47428b1b395aeb9d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":